voix bundles or downloads third-party components:

- Kokoro-82M v1.0 ONNX model and voice embeddings
  https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX (Apache-2.0),
  derived from https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M (Apache-2.0).
  The 28 English voice files are embedded in the executable; the model is downloaded on first use.
- Text normalization and phoneme post-processing ported from kokoro-js (Apache-2.0).
- ONNX Runtime (onnxruntime-node), MIT. The matching darwin-arm64 or linux-x64 shared library is embedded in each executable.
- phonemizer (Apache-2.0 wrapper) which embeds a WebAssembly build of eSpeak NG.
  eSpeak NG is GPL-3.0-or-later: https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng
  Because that build ships inside the voix executable, redistributors should review the GPL-3.0
  obligations for the combined binary. This is a known open item for the project license.
- Effect (MIT), Bun runtime (MIT).
